[I] A compiler for HLSL to DXIL (DirectX Intermediate Language)

[T] The DirectX Shader Compiler (dxc) project includes a compiler and related
[T] tools used to compile High-Level Shader Language (HLSL) programs into DirectX
[T] Intermediate Language (DXIL) representation. Applications that make use of
[T] DirectX for graphics, games, and computation can use it to generate shader
[T] programs.

[U] https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler

[A] Microsoft
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[E] opt go

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.10.2605.37
[P] X -----5---9 127.443

[D] 6ecc76bfd2d2a05813794e3180fb4943db508e567ab89e6758a26b5b DirectXShaderCompiler-v1.10.2605.37.tar.gz git+https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler v1.10.2605.37

makeinstopt=
var_remove cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -C../cmake/caches/PredefinedParams.cmake

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DHLSL_DISABLE_SOURCE_GENERATION=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' '"-DCROSS_TOOLCHAIN_FLAGS_NATIVE=-C$PWD/../cmake/caches/PredefinedParams.cmake;-DHLSL_DISABLE_SOURCE_GENERATION=ON;-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=$BUILDCC;-DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=$BUILDCXX"'

hook_add postmake 5 "install bin/dxc $root$bindir/"
hook_add postmake 5 "install lib/libdxcompiler.so* $root$libdir/"
